OL,3,ATemperatures to touch 27C despite more
OL,4,Arain on the way for some
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigher pressure keeps things much drier
OL,7,Facross the southern half of England and
OL,8,FWales, where drought conditions and
OL,9,Fhosepipe bans continue.
